{"3698140": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Level 11.11", "steam_appid": 3698140, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698140/extras/c7fb45f9d7899a4a6683399dabc3c97c.poster.avif?t=1761296065\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698140/extras/c7fb45f9d7899a4a6683399dabc3c97c.webm?t=1761296065\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698140/extras/c7fb45f9d7899a4a6683399dabc3c97c.mp4?t=1761296065\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level 11.11 is a brutal, first-person shooter co-op horror, where you and your team embark on a dangerous journey into the ever-changing Flooded City dimension. Avoid monsters, gather intel, and complete many objectives that stand between you and the exit back to the real world. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Up to four person cooperation</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Level 11.11 every person counts. At the start of each mission each player chooses their specialised equipment that will define their playstyle and specific role in the team. Do you want to be a spotter who will tell the rest where the enemies are or do you want to choose something more... violent? Choose wisely, because once you embark on your journey there is no way to change it to something else. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698140/extras/ae69c0be15975c61fc12f3db71938731.poster.avif?t=1761296065\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698140/extras/ae69c0be15975c61fc12f3db71938731.webm?t=1761296065\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698140/extras/ae69c0be15975c61fc12f3db71938731.mp4?t=1761296065\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Don't wake them up</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival depends not only on raw firepower. Resources are limited and sooner or later they will run out. Many creatures in the Flooded City are hibernating and can be avoided - if you can spot them before they can spot you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698140/extras/bd74c06b8e08d59845982ee564448a87.poster.avif?t=1761296065\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698140/extras/bd74c06b8e08d59845982ee564448a87.webm?t=1761296065\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698140/extras/bd74c06b8e08d59845982ee564448a87.mp4?t=1761296065\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Procedurally generated levels</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each time you enter a mission the world around you will change - new areas, new terrain layouts, new objectives. No two missions will be the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698140/extras/74b66040f0c46deca99a507bf7a23ee5.poster.avif?t=1761296065\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698140/extras/74b66040f0c46deca99a507bf7a23ee5.webm?t=1761296065\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698140/extras/74b66040f0c46deca99a507bf7a23ee5.mp4?t=1761296065\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698140/extras/c7fb45f9d7899a4a6683399dabc3c97c.poster.avif?t=1761296065\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698140/extras/c7fb45f9d7899a4a6683399dabc3c97c.webm?t=1761296065\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698140/extras/c7fb45f9d7899a4a6683399dabc3c97c.mp4?t=1761296065\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level 11.11 is a brutal, first-person shooter co-op horror, where you and your team embark on a dangerous journey into the ever-changing Flooded City dimension. Avoid monsters, gather intel, and complete many objectives that stand between you and the exit back to the real world. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Up to four person cooperation</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Level 11.11 every person counts. At the start of each mission each player chooses their specialised equipment that will define their playstyle and specific role in the team. Do you want to be a spotter who will tell the rest where the enemies are or do you want to choose something more... violent? Choose wisely, because once you embark on your journey there is no way to change it to something else. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.s